{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["rs"],"desc":"Commit one store unit by closure (the resolver's write side): resolves lib+ctl in the LIVE store, gathers the control record and every id-prefixed sibling (facets, _patches journal), each command record with its typed impls and their attachments, timer/event components, the controls index, and the generated newbound_core/src/<lib>/<ctl>/ sources; stages exactly those paths (add -A --) and commits with a pathspec (commit -m msg -- paths), so nothing of the unit is overlooked and pre-staged unrelated work stays staged, untouched. A component already deleted from the store is outside the closure and needs a manual commit - the store can only name what it still knows. Returns {unit, control_id, staged, skipped, committed, out}.","import":"use flowlang::datastore::DataStore;\nuse ndata::dataarray::DataArray;\nuse ndata::data::Data;","params":[{"name":"repo","type":"String"},{"name":"lib","type":"String"},{"name":"ctl","type":"String"},{"name":"message","type":"String"},{"name":"author","type":"String"},{"name":"nn_sessionid","type":"String"}],"returntype":"FLAT","type":"rust"},"id":"rgkipv1a05d34ad79m3","readers":[],"time":1788270145937,"username":"system","writers":[]}